1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Double-click to open the Printed Files folder.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Find the F Adding Plates in Scene Details.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Double-click on Knife Plates.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Or drag it to the 2D or 3D window.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Enter the window and double-click on the name of the Aorta file.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Enter Fibonacci and drag it to the 2D or 3D window.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Enter the Fibonacci and drag it to the 2D or 3D window.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Enter the Fibonacci and drag it to the 2D window.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Also, drag it to the 3D window.

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Lock a line of the Flare from the Flare tool.

11
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Lock a line of the Flare tool.

12
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
In the 2D tool bar, select the Center Blur Tool.

13
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Select all the foundation lines from the 2D window.

14
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Set the base line to the inner line.

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Select the 5th of the 2D full-fledged blueprints.

16
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Click to lock the panel outline.

17
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Unlock the panel outline.

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
In the 2D tool, select the fold and fold tool.

19
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Set the fold and fold direction.

20
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Click the 2D window next to the skirt panel and move the mouse.

21
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The arrow follows the light.

22
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,000
It means that the fold will be folded.

23
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Pass the arrow through the entire skirt panel.

24
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Double-click to complete the setting direction.

25
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,000
When the fold and fold buttons pop out of the window,

26
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:34,000
select Follow and then click OK.

27
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Repeat this operation on the back of the skirt panel.

28
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,000
In the 2D tool bar, select the fold and fold tool.

29
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Fold the button.

30
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Start folding through a section of the belt of the single button.

31
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Then press again when the shelf is finished.

32
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000
This is the first half of the fold.

33
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,000
The second part of the fold, the seven points of the single button菷

34
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,920
Select else from the boxes at the end of the shelf

35
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,519
Then press again when the details are completed.

36
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:06,480
Make sure the fold and fold are aligned

37
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:10,000
and follow the thickening direction of the fold.

38
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Use thereturn to countdown if necessary.

39
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Use the Line Selection tool to divide the panels into sections.

40
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Select the 4th panel of the 3D vertical tool bar.

41
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Click on the display point.

42
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:36,000
The blue point will be displayed around the 3D window virtual model.

43
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Select all panels in the 2D window.

44
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Press Ctrl A to select all panels.

45
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Move the panels up and down.

46
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Enter the blocked point.

47
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Arrange the panels around the model.

48
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Adjust the position of the panels in the purple bar arranged by the virtual machine.

49
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Select the mouse to the 4th panel of the 3D vertical tool bar.

50
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Click on the display point.

51
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,000
Hide the display point.

52
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,000
Select the 1 panel in the 2D window.

53
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:18,000
In the virtual machine, select the 1 panel.

54
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Paste the 1 panel.

55
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:27,000
In the 2D window, press Shift to select the front and back panels.

56
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:30,000
In the 3D window, right-click on the panel.

57
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,000
Select Harden on the menu.

58
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Harden is to temporarily increase the hardness of the panel.

59
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,000
You can also fold it.

60
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Activate the model.

61
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:45,000
The panel will be folded quickly.

62
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
When the folding model is completed,

63
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Unhaze the skirt panels.

64
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,000
To unhaze the panels, select all panels.

65
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,000
The touch icon is a bit single.

66
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Drag it to the menu.

67
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Select the Unhaze panel.

68
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,000
Activate the model.

69
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,000
You can see the strength of the skirt.

